title: "ScarCodec v6.3-Biorthogonal, ScarField v7.5-Fused, Mixture of Scars (MoS), and SCache O(1): Zero-PyTorch C99/SIMD Lattice Compression, Constant-Memory Dual Telemetry, and Zero-Legacy Spherical Neural Fields"
